  "limitations": [
    "Current EssentiaTransfuser uses explicit predecessor THAUMATORIUM/INFUSION,16 raw Observation Alchemy and16 Artifice,original physical bench inputs/crystals,aura250,fullmoon,loaded neighbours/flux1000,arena and empty physical endpoints. Raw24Ignis in the source Alembic and the collector Ignis label are deferred until after their actually paid device placements. Actual C2S research pays16+16 Observation and awards10XP total(start5+completion5); two bench crafts pay100vis/Aer1/Aqua1 each, then ordinary fifth-tick transfers move source24->airjar24->collector24. No finished device is supplied and no direct manager transfer or device tick is invoked. Original six-facing gallery renders are read-only previews. These conditions do not establish full manual survival.",
    "Current LateGolem uses explicit predecessor research,arena/loaded navigation region,raw knowledge,input stacks/crystals,aura and physical altar/source fixtures. Actual C2S scans and four research payments precede paid HungryChest/Levitator arcane outputs,75essentia JarBrain infusion with bucket remainder,XP capture/release,paid factory Flyer and elevated physical Collect/Store flight. Finished new outputs are not supplied. These prepared conditions do not establish a complete manual survival campaign.",
    "79 canonical research keys are supported: preserved78 plus ESSENTIATRANSPORT. MATSTUDVOID,BASEELDRITCH and remaining late/world gates stay closed. Full Golemancy and fullTC6 are not complete.",
    "Infusion preserves56 recipes,the same16 implemented research/craft paths,14 established ordinary-source paths and40 late research gates. No new infusion path opens in0.25. Firebat/Pech/Primordial Pearl natural world acquisition for Advanced/Greater remains unfinished.",
    "All21 original focus nodes and prior production/Thaumatorium/Hedge/Clockwork/Infusion features are preserved in the full server suite. Separate current client evidence is only EssentiaTransfuser10 and LateGolem15;0.24 Golemancy/LateGolem,0.23 Golemancy and0.22 GolemPress/EssentiaProduction evidence remains explicitly historical.",
    "Transfusers preserve five-tick,one-unit,rear-only ports and the original asymmetric directional range16 box,shared cache/cooldown,two-pass jar insertion,positive no-storage advisory API and absence of redstone gating. Loaded-only migration,owned one-shot confirmations,guarded native-class transfers and rollback are modern hardening. Foreign paid transport callbacks,essentia mirrors/cross-dimension routing and original custom stream ribbon FX remain unsupported; native colored server-routed trails are the documented visual adaptation.",
    "Pinned release quirks remain,including partial levitator-buffer final lift debt,refill while powered,opaque-scan boundary inclusion,BrainJar delayed XP recapture,props0 press animation and final blocked-output zero-cost stall. Modern navigation/render buffers/native particles,loaded-only checks,NBT bounds,transaction guards and dictionary-to-tags are documented adaptations.",
    "Natural original zombie brain drop/scan hooks are connected. Brainy catalogue entities and incomplete TC6 world ecology are not a claim of completed natural generation. All hidden-client input desktops stayed Default; no independent-client multiplayer validation is established."
  ],
